  "curveRule": "Ramer-Douglas-Peucker at 2.5 mask samples",
  "authoredObstacles": "the well is authored, not derived -- its rim is cobble and no local test can separate it",
  "overheadExemptions": "3 derived obstacle(s) dropped as OVERHEAD (mast, hanging demijohn): a top-down painting cannot encode height, so props the player walks beneath read as solid"
